    "starterCode": "def compare_ldo_vs_buck(v_in, v_out, i_load, buck_eff=0.90):\n    # TODO 1: Compute:\n    #   p_ldo_heat = (v_in - v_out) * i_load\n    #   i_buck_in  = (v_out * i_load) / (buck_eff * v_in)\n    #   p_buck_heat = (v_in * i_buck_in) - (v_out * i_load)\n    p_ldo_heat = 0.0\n    i_buck_in = 0.0\n    p_buck_heat = 0.0\n    return p_ldo_heat, i_buck_in, p_buck_heat\n\n\ndef worst_case_battery_budget(i_motor_stall, i_buck_in, safety_factor=1.25):\n    # TODO 2: Compute i_total_peak = i_motor_stall + i_buck_in and\n    #         fuse_rating_a = i_total_peak * safety_factor\n    i_total_peak = 0.0\n    fuse_rating_a = 0.0\n    return i_total_peak, fuse_rating_a\n\n\np_ldo, i_buck, p_buck = compare_ldo_vs_buck(12.0, 5.0, 0.50, buck_eff=0.90)\ni_peak, fuse_a = worst_case_battery_budget(i_motor_stall=3.00, i_buck_in=i_buck)\n\nprint(f\"LDO heat loss : {p_ldo:.2f} W (at 12V -> 5V, 0.50 A)\")\nprint(f\"Buck input    : {i_buck:.3f} A | Buck heat loss: {p_buck:.2f} W\")\nprint(f\"Battery peak  : {i_peak:.3f} A | Recommended fuse (1.25x): {fuse_a:.2f} A\")",
